0,Autonomous Region of Bougainville - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Autonomous_Region_of_Bougainville,"Bougainville, officially the Autonomous Region of Bougainville, is an autonomous region in Papua New Guinea. The largest island is Bougainville Island, while the region also includes Buka Island and a number of outlying islands and atolls.",Ramopa,North Bougainville
