2,Bougainville languages - Sorosoro Sorosoro,https://www.sorosoro.org/en/bougainville-languages/,"North Bougainville. Ramopa. Rapoisi. Askopan. Rotokas. Comments on the classification of Bougainville languages: These two branches have sometimes been classified separately, their grouping together is perhaps more geographic than linguistic.",Ramopa,North Bougainville
3,Ramopa language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/ramopa_language,"Within the North Bougainville family, Ramopa is positioned in the Keriaka cluster, alongside Konua (also called Rapoisi), based on shared innovations in pronominal paradigms that indicate common ancestry.",Ramopa,North Bougainville
